<title>POLAND: NFI FOKSAL NETS PLN 17.1 MLN Q2.</title>
<headline>NFI FOKSAL NETS PLN 17.1 MLN Q2.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish National Investment Fund</p>
<p>(NFI) Foksal's preliminary results for the second quarter of</p>
<p>1997, in millions of zlotys:</p>
<p>					Q2 1997		    Q2 1996</p>
<p>  Net profit			 17.07		(loss)  9.58</p>
<p>  Investment portfolio	  478.16			465.57</p>
<p>  Liabilities and reserves     12.38			  6.49</p>
<p>  Net assets			472.61			463.40</p>
<p>  Assets per share (PLN)	 15.23			 14.97</p>
<p>NOTE: The company full name is Narodowy Fundusz Inwestycyjny</p>
<p>Foksal SA.  -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
